{"title": "Prepare first-year college funding schedule", "templateId": null, "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-02-21", "assigneeId": null, "subTasks": [], "text": "Map Lila Pebblefizz's first-year cost at Buttonwood Balloon University against the $12,000 merit scholarship, the Lila 529 account at Velvet Acorn Custody ($103,800), available Teacup Comet Bank checking cash, and any remaining gap, so Nadia and Owen Pebblefizz can see the order and timing of likely funding sources.", "evidence": "Nadia asked Pocket Lantern Advisory to map Lila's expected first-year cost against the merit scholarship, the Lila 529 account, available checking cash, and any remaining gap so the household can see the order and timing of likely funding sources. The agreed follow-up is to prepare that first-year college funding schedule by 2025-02-21."},
{"title": "Prepare Lila 529 investment positioning review", "templateId": null, "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-02-24", "assigneeId": null, "subTasks": [], "text": "Prepare risk-reduction options for the Lila 529 account at Velvet Acorn Custody, currently about 70% equity-oriented and 30% short-term bond and cash-equivalent options, ahead of the next withdrawal decision given near-term tuition use.", "evidence": "The team noted that the account still had a large equity-oriented allocation despite the near-term tuition use, and the discussion covered preparing risk-reduction options before the next withdrawal decision. The agreed follow-up is to prepare the Lila 529 investment positioning review by 2025-02-24."},
{"title": "Collect university aid and billing documents", "templateId": null, "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-02-18", "assigneeId": null, "subTasks": [], "text": "Collect from Nadia Pebblefizz the final Buttonwood Balloon University billing statement, itemized fee schedule, and complete financial aid portal export, since the analysis depends on the confirmed net amount owed after the $12,000 scholarship.", "evidence": "Nadia did not have the final university billing statement, itemized fee schedule, or complete financial aid portal export available during the meeting, and the analysis depends on the confirmed net amount owed after the scholarship. The agreed follow-up is to collect the university aid and billing documents by 2025-02-18."},
{"title": "Resolve housing deposit credit mismatch", "templateId": null, "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-02-20", "assigneeId": null, "subTasks": [], "text": "Reconcile the accepted housing deposit that appears in the Buttonwood Balloon University payment portal but is absent from Nadia Pebblefizz's printed student account statement, to confirm the remaining balance to fund for Lila's first year.", "evidence": "Nadia showed that the accepted housing deposit appeared in the portal but was absent from the printed statement, creating uncertainty about the remaining balance to fund. The agreed follow-up is to address the housing deposit credit mismatch by 2025-02-20."},
{"title": "Follow up on account security concern", "templateId": "e60cbf3c-ee73-5fc7-b200-220ac603a8f5", "priority": "high", "dueDate": "2025-02-17", "assigneeId": null, "subTasks": [], "text": "Contact the client to confirm whether access has been secured, recommend password and multifactor authentication review, document any suspicious activity, and escalate to the custodian if unauthorized access or transactions are suspected. Owen Pebblefizz's Velvet Acorn Custody login was locked after an identity-verification attempt, and the household wants both parents able to view the Lila 529 account before withdrawal planning.", "evidence": "Nadia reported that Owen's Velvet Acorn Custody login was locked after an identity-verification attempt, and the household wants both parents able to view the education account before withdrawal planning. The agreed follow-up is to address Owen's locked 529 account access by 2025-02-17."},
{"title": "Reflect Owen's reduced schedule on college cash flow", "templateId": null, "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-03-03", "assigneeId": null, "subTasks": [], "text": "Update the education funding plan for Nadia and Owen Pebblefizz to reflect Owen's reduced four-day schedule at Paper Otter Works, which lowered his salary from $142,000 to $112,000, while preserving the stated emergency reserve preference of at least six months of core household expenses in cash.", "evidence": "Owen's move to a four-day schedule reduced household salary income, and the education funding plan needs to reflect the lower recurring cash flow while preserving the stated emergency reserve preference. The agreed follow-up is to reflect the effect of Owen's reduced work schedule on college cash flow by 2025-03-03."},
{"title": "Prepare payment plan and short-term borrowing comparison", "templateId": null, "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-03-10", "assigneeId": null, "subTasks": [], "text": "Compare the Buttonwood Balloon University monthly payment plan, a draw on the $120,000 home equity line, and a limited taxable brokerage sale at Velvet Acorn Custody for any first-year shortfall remaining after scholarship and 529 funding for Lila Pebblefizz.", "evidence": "Nadia requested a comparison of the university monthly payment plan, a home equity line draw, and a limited taxable brokerage sale for any first-year shortfall that remains after scholarship and 529 funding. The agreed follow-up is to prepare the payment plan and short-term borrowing comparison by 2025-03-10."},
{"title": "Review concentrated position risk and planning choices", "templateId": "e5ca3fcb-f934-5f93-aa1f-a8da447fe4f7", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": "2025-03-05", "assigneeId": null, "subTasks": [
